This plugin forwards the calls of the local ModemManager modems to the device
as "kdeconnect.telephony" packets, with "event" set to "ringing" or "talking",
"phoneNumber" and "contactName" set to the number of the call, and "isCancel"
set to true when the call ends.

It executes "kdeconnect.telephony.request_action" packets ("answer", "reject",
"hangup") from the device through the ModemManager Call API and replies with
"kdeconnect.telephony.action_status". See docs/specs/callhandoff.md.
